{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-ocean-cove","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"ocean-cove-emaar-properties-rashid-yachts-marina","about":"Discover the tranquil beauty of Ocean Cove at Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina, where nature and urban life harmoniously blend to create an enchanting environment. The Emaar Ocean Cove project in Dubai features architecture that embodies Dubai's innovative spirit, combining classic elegance with modern design. Utilizing premium, nature-inspired materials, it captures the city's architectural progress while enhancing cultural richness. The one-bedroom Ocean Cove apartments are ideal for singles or couples, featuring roomy layouts, open kitchens, and private balconies. The larger two- and three-bedroom units boast en-suite bathrooms, generous wardrobe space, and spacious balconies.Located in the heart of Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina, Ocean Cove by Emaar offers an elegant lifestyle that merges the serene charm of a high-end waterfront community with the dynamic, diverse energy of Dubai. It’s a sanctuary where luxury and comfort coexist, set against the serene backdrop of lush greenery. Explore the seashore serenity at Ocean Cove Emaar Dubai, and benefit from the convenient amenities including a clinic right next to the property and a school just a short stroll away. Discover more about the Emaar Ocean Cove location, the comprehensive Ocean Cove Emaar master plan, and the attractive Ocean Cove Emaar payment plan. For detailed information, refer to the Ocean Cove brochure and floor plan below.","price":1760000,"title":"Ocean Cove","bitrix":{"id":719,"pf_id":"are.2.14067","source":null,"project_id":"Ocean Cove","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Marina View Tower A","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Mina Rashid"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Ocean_Cove_Apartments